{"unit_id":"ElioFanyu__dsh-desktop-bridge#feature-1","repo":"ElioFanyu/dsh-desktop-bridge","commit":"6b25cc323057a6e29af263d2af831616f9db3b24","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-bridge 的功能「会话状态桌面提醒」：在 Windows 显示会话等待确认、正常完成或失败的 toast 通知。浏览器端观察状态变化并向宿主提交事件，宿主负责派发通知。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:20-25","lib/client.js:180-185","lib/host/dispatch.js:62-80","lib/host/toast.js:43-69"]}
{"unit_id":"ElioFanyu__dsh-desktop-bridge#feature-2","repo":"ElioFanyu/dsh-desktop-bridge","commit":"6b25cc323057a6e29af263d2af831616f9db3b24","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-bridge 的功能「通知降噪」：对重复事件、免打扰时段和短时间内的同类提醒应用过滤或合并规则，减少重复弹窗。无需额外触发操作，收到会话事件时自动处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host/dispatch.js:49-59","lib/host/dispatch.js:88-129","lib/host/dispatch.js:144-191"]}
